  <h2 id="client">MdbaseCollectionClient</h2>
  <p>
    Import from <code>@mdbase-dev/connect/advanced</code> and construct with
    any <code>MdbaseCollectionTransport</code>. It exposes the
    record, query, view, type, validation, and timer methods above. Its surface
    is limited to collection behavior. Domain packages should prefer this
    dependency when they use collection operations alone.
  </p>

