    Expected failures are <code>ConnectOutcome</code> data:
    {" "}<code>{`{ ok: false, problem }`}</code> with a stable
    {" "}<code>code</code>, a <code>category</code>, a suggested
    {" "}<code>recovery</code>, and code-specific <code>details</code>.
  </p>
